
==============================================================================================================
S. Symbolic: the v3s J term, the static limit, the a0-charge, the phi equation, FRW decoupling, running law
==============================================================================================================
  L_J(g; a0) = a0*(-a0*(-log(a0) + log(a0 + g)) + g)/(4*pi*G)
  dL_total/dg = -(g/4 pi G) mu,  mu = g/(a0 + g)
  [PASS] S1 v3s static limit is AQUAL with mu = x/(1+x) (law S: g mu(g/a0) = g_N), whatever sets a0
  q = a0 dL_J/da0|_g = (a0^2/4 pi G) h(x), h = (x**2 + 2*x - (2*x + 2)*log(x + 1))/(x + 1)
  [PASS] S2 the v3s a0-charge equals CFG911's h(x) = x/(1+x) + x - 2 ln(1+x) (CFG911 used the S2 Phi-P action)
  [PASS] S3 h(x) <= x for x > 0 (so q <= a0 g/K, an upper bound robust to v3s's screening)
  d ln a0/d phi = -lambda/(2*phi_P)   (|.| = lambda/(2 phi_P))
  delta ln a0 = G*lambda**2/(2*c**4) * int q/|x-x'| d^3x'
  [PASS] S4 delta ln a0 = (G lambda^2/2c^4) int q/|x-x'| (CFG911's N6 formula, re-derived from the v3s phi equation)
  d q/d ln a0|_g = (a0^2/4 pi G) k(x), k = 2h - x h' = 4*x**2/(x + 1)**2 + x + 3*x/(x + 1)**2 - 4*log(x + 1)
  [PASS] S4b the hand form k = 2h - x h' equals the symbolic a0 dq/da0|_g
  dJ/dY = -a0/(sqrt(Y)*c**2 + a0);  lim_(Y->0) d^2J/dY da0 = 0;  lim dJ/dY = -1
  [PASS] S5 FRW (Y = 0): the khronon's quadratic coefficient J'(0) = -1 is a0-free, so phi decouples at quadratic order
  [PASS] S6 J depends on phi only through a0(phi), no derivative of phi: 4 DOF (v3s's 3 + phi), phi kinetic matrix diagonal, sign +
  [PASS] S7 continuity: d rho/dt = -3H(rho + p) from KG
  [PASS] S8 potential portal: d ln a0/d ln a = -(3/2)(1+w) - w'/(2(1-w)), w' = dw/d ln a (derived from KG)
  [PASS] S9 CT1's -(3/2)(1+w) is NOT the N6 law in general (difference -w'/(1-w) in d ln V/d ln a is nonzero)
         (d ln V/d ln a - [-3(1+w)] = -phidot*(3*H*phidot**3 + 2*V*phiddot + phiddot*phidot**2)/(H*V*(2*V + phidot**2)))

